<title>POLAND: Novita 1996 group net up to PLN 2.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Novita 1996 group net up to PLN 2.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novita group results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		     7.70   vs    4.61</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			 4.65   vs    2.42</p>
<p>    Group net profit			     2.07   vs    1.60</p>
<p>    Group net sales			     99.24   vs   73.41</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales			70.57   vs   53.64</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit		 1.40   vs    1.67</p>
<p>    Group income tax			     4.65   vs    2.42</p>
<p>    Group other taxes				na   vs	na</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		   1.13   vs    1.46</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			5.15   vs    5.31</p>
<p>    Group investment			     7.83   vs   10.31</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Novita SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
